sequenceDiagram
    participant Patient
    participant Hospital as Hospital Admin
    participant Bank
    participant BlockchainService as Blockchain
    participant AssetDepositService as Deposit Service
    participant MarketplaceService as Marketplace
    participant HospitalAtPoolService as AT Pool Service
    participant AtTradingService as AT Trading
    participant ProfitAllocationService as Profit Service

    rect rgb(200, 230, 255)
    Note over Patient,BlockchainService: PHASE 1: Asset Deposit & AT Minting
    
    Patient->>AssetDepositService: Submit asset deposit (10,000 PKR)
    AssetDepositService->>Hospital: Request approval
    Hospital->>AssetDepositService: Approve request
    
    AssetDepositService->>Bank: Forward for bank approval
    Bank->>BlockchainService: Mint 100 AT (10,000÷100)
    BlockchainService->>BlockchainService: Create AT on-chain
    
    BlockchainService->>BlockchainService: Mint 100 HT (1 AT = 1 HT)
    BlockchainService->>AssetDepositService: ✅ AT/HT minted
    
    AssetDepositService->>AssetDepositService: Update PatientTokenBalance
    AssetDepositService->>AssetDepositService: Create PatientAtAssignment
    AssetDepositService->>HospitalAtPoolService: Add to AT pool
    AssetDepositService->>Patient: ✅ Deposit approved
    Note right of Patient: Balance: 100 HT, 100 AT (available)
    end

    rect rgb(240, 255, 240)
    Note over Patient,ProfitAllocationService: PHASE 2: Trade Execution & AT Burning
    
    Hospital->>MarketplaceService: Create trade (BUY, 700 AT needed)
    MarketplaceService->>HospitalAtPoolService: Check available AT
    HospitalAtPoolService->>MarketplaceService: ✅ 700 AT available
    
    MarketplaceService->>MarketplaceService: Simulate trade (price, duration, P&L)
    
    MarketplaceService->>HospitalAtPoolService: Burn 700 AT (FIFO allocation)
    HospitalAtPoolService->>HospitalAtPoolService: Patient1: Burn 100 AT
    HospitalAtPoolService->>HospitalAtPoolService: Patient2: Burn 300 AT
    HospitalAtPoolService->>HospitalAtPoolService: Patient3: Burn 200 AT
    HospitalAtPoolService->>HospitalAtPoolService: Update all PatientAtAssignments
    
    HospitalAtPoolService->>AtTradingService: ✅ AT burned, create participations
    AtTradingService->>AtTradingService: Create TradeParticipation (per patient)
    AtTradingService->>AtTradingService: Create MonthlyHtDistribution (6 months)
    Note right of AtTradingService: P1: 500 HT/month, P2: 150 HT/mo, P3: 100 HT/mo
    
    MarketplaceService->>MarketplaceService: Create MarketplaceTrade (ACTIVE)
    MarketplaceService->>Patient: ✅ Trade started
    end

    rect rgb(255, 240, 245)
    Note over Patient,AtTradingService: PHASE 3: Monthly HT Distribution (ongoing)
    
    loop For Each Month (1-6 months)
        AtTradingService->>AtTradingService: markMonthlyDistributionDistributed()
        AtTradingService->>Patient: ✅ Monthly HT distributed
        Note right of Patient: Month 1: +500 HT (P1), +150 HT (P2), +100 HT (P3)
    end
    end

    rect rgb(255, 250, 205)
    Note over Patient,ProfitAllocationService: PHASE 4: Trade Settlement & Profit Distribution
    
    Hospital->>MarketplaceService: Close trade
    MarketplaceService->>MarketplaceService: MarketplaceTrade status = CLOSED
    MarketplaceService->>MarketplaceService: Calculate profit: 3000 PKR
    
    MarketplaceService->>AtTradingService: Settle trade (3000 PKR profit)
    
    AtTradingService->>AtTradingService: For each TradeParticipation:
    AtTradingService->>AtTradingService: Collect monthly HT (Patient1: 3000, P2: 900, P3: 600)
    AtTradingService->>AtTradingService: Calculate profit HT (P1: 2143×0.1=214, P2: 428×0.1=42.8, P3: 428×0.1=42.8)
    
    AtTradingService->>AtTradingService: Create TradeAtSettlement records
    AtTradingService->>AtTradingService: Return AT to PatientAtAssignment (available)
    Note right of AtTradingService: availableAt restored, unavailableAt = 0
    
    AtTradingService->>Patient: ✅ Trade settled, AT returned + Profit HT issued
    Note right of Patient: P1 gets: 100 AT + 3214 HT, P2: 300 AT + 942.8 HT, P3: 200 AT + 642.8 HT
    
    AtTradingService->>ProfitAllocationService: Distribute hospital profit
    ProfitAllocationService->>ProfitAllocationService: Calculate patient shares
    ProfitAllocationService->>ProfitAllocationService: P1 share: 100/700 × 3000 = 2142.86 PKR
    ProfitAllocationService->>ProfitAllocationService: Convert to HT: 2142.86 × 0.1 = 214.3 HT
    
    ProfitAllocationService->>ProfitAllocationService: Create ProfitDistribution & ProfitAllocation records
    ProfitAllocationService->>Patient: ✅ Profit share allocated
    Note right of Patient: P1 +214.3 HT, P2: +42.86 HT, P3: +42.86 HT
    end

    rect rgb(240, 248, 245)
    Note over Patient,ProfitAllocationService: FINAL STATE: Patient Holdings
    
    Patient->>Patient: SUMMARY<br/>P1: 100 AT + 3428.3 HT<br/>P2: 300 AT + 985.66 HT<br/>P3: 200 AT + 685.66 HT
    Note right of Patient: All AT returned (AVAILABLE)<br/>HT = Initial + Monthly + Profit + Share
    end